1
00:00:02,381 --> 00:00:05,200
Management says coding ain't the bottleneck.

2
00:00:07,669 --> 00:00:09,240
Then what's the bottleneck?

3
00:00:14,557 --> 00:00:14,780
Thinking.

4
00:00:27,186 --> 00:00:29,420
Eyes glazed over in cubicles, nobody's there,

5
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,680
Thirteen-hour shifts in an ergonomic chair.

6
00:00:32,082 --> 00:00:34,280
Ticket from a chatbot, specs from a clone,

7
00:00:34,623 --> 00:00:36,920
Code from a model that nobody owns.

8
00:00:37,061 --> 00:00:39,160
Tests wrote the tests, gave themselves a green light,

9
00:00:39,261 --> 00:00:41,620
Bot approved the merge at a quarter past midnight.

10
00:00:41,761 --> 00:00:44,080
Boss says "Ship faster!" — we say "What did we make?"

11
00:00:44,461 --> 00:00:46,700
He says "Who gives a fuck? The numbers look great!"

12
00:00:46,942 --> 00:00:49,080
L-one to L-seven, all ranks are the same,

13
00:00:49,161 --> 00:00:51,760
Expensive meat puppets in a context-window game.

14
00:00:52,123 --> 00:00:54,140
Used to solve problems, used to know why,

15
00:00:54,281 --> 00:00:56,539
Now we watch the little spinner while our brain cells die.

16
00:00:56,801 --> 00:00:59,279
Ten thousand commits, got a dashboard to brag,

17
00:00:59,441 --> 00:01:01,760
Production's on fire but the build's got a badge.

18
00:01:01,921 --> 00:01:04,200
Nobody read shit, nobody knows how,

19
00:01:04,563 --> 00:01:05,640
Welcome to the future ...

20
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:08,780
SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (NOW!)

21
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:11,580
Brains unplugged, let the bots run this town!

22
00:01:11,984 --> 00:01:13,317
SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (HOW?)

23
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,559
Everybody ships, nobody knows how!

24
00:01:17,025 --> 00:01:18,119
PRESS ENTER! (ENTER!)

25
00:01:18,281 --> 00:01:20,197
Watch the bullshit go round and round!

26
00:01:21,841 --> 00:01:23,356
SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (NOW!)

27
00:01:23,780 --> 00:01:26,639
The lights are on but the minds shut down!

28
00:01:26,902 --> 00:01:28,959
Your AI wrote the memo, mine wrote the reply,

29
00:01:29,181 --> 00:01:31,720
His AI said "Great point!" — no one asked why.

30
00:01:31,780 --> 00:01:34,100
Four bots in a meeting, not a thought in the room,

31
00:01:34,261 --> 00:01:36,540
Just a circle jerk of tokens spelling corporate doom.

32
00:01:36,621 --> 00:01:39,080
Consultant sends a slide deck, forty pages of fluff,

33
00:01:39,221 --> 00:01:41,760
Client feeds it to a model: "Summarize this stuff."

34
00:01:41,921 --> 00:01:44,620
The bot says "Brilliant!" and the suits all cheer,

35
00:01:44,780 --> 00:01:47,300
A million bucks to tell them what they want to hear.

36
00:01:47,602 --> 00:01:49,780
"AI's just a tool, bro!" — yeah, no shit,

37
00:01:50,121 --> 00:01:52,380
A tool needs a brain — you disconnected it.

38
00:01:52,602 --> 00:01:54,680
Confidently wrong in a beautiful tone,

39
00:01:54,781 --> 00:01:57,360
Hallucinated facts getting carved into stone.

40
00:01:57,582 --> 00:01:59,640
A polished fake answer with a made-up cite,

41
00:01:59,741 --> 00:02:02,300
Nobody checks the source, so it must be right.

42
00:02:02,461 --> 00:02:04,719
We sped up the process, now take a bow,

43
00:02:05,061 --> 00:02:07,519
Nobody knows what the fuck they're doing now.

44
00:02:07,922 --> 00:02:09,698
SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (NOW!)

45
00:02:10,222 --> 00:02:12,840
Brains unplugged, let the bots run this town!

46
00:02:13,163 --> 00:02:14,637
SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (HOW?)

47
00:02:15,282 --> 00:02:17,698
Everybody ships, nobody knows how!

48
00:02:18,264 --> 00:02:19,278
PRESS ENTER! (ENTER!)

49
00:02:19,540 --> 00:02:21,894
Watch the bullshit go round and round!

50
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,300
SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (NOW!)

51
00:02:23,782 --> 00:02:27,959
The lights are on but the minds shut down!

52
00:02:28,321 --> 00:02:30,519
Teacher got a lesson that the kids won't read,

53
00:02:30,821 --> 00:02:32,960
Kids got an essay that they never conceived.

54
00:02:33,363 --> 00:02:35,480
Boss got a strategy, lawyer got a brief,

55
00:02:35,681 --> 00:02:37,940
They've all got the answers they don't believe.

56
00:02:38,383 --> 00:02:40,659
Ask a simple question, watch the whole room freeze,

57
00:02:40,881 --> 00:02:43,200
"Hang on, let me ask my AI, please."

58
00:02:43,460 --> 00:02:45,279
Can't defend a sentence, can't explain a claim,

59
00:02:45,501 --> 00:02:47,940
But the bot did the work and you signed your name.

60
00:02:48,162 --> 00:02:50,459
We rent back our thoughts, pay the bill by the token,

61
00:02:50,822 --> 00:02:52,979
Thinking was a muscle; now that fucker's broken.

62
00:02:53,281 --> 00:02:55,460
Sold our own thoughts for a shortcut and a smile,

63
00:02:55,722 --> 00:02:57,859
Up until midnight, watch the progress bars compile.

64
00:02:58,302 --> 00:03:00,400
Ain't scared of Skynet showing up with a gun,

65
00:03:00,521 --> 00:03:02,920
I'm scared what we've become, and the war ain't begun.

66
00:03:03,021 --> 00:03:05,420
No robot uprising, no machine took the crown,

67
00:03:05,682 --> 00:03:08,340
We handed them our brains, then we quietly sat down.

68
00:03:09,527 --> 00:03:10,320
What is my purpose?

69
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,116
You press Enter.

70
00:03:14,620 --> 00:03:17,030
Looks good to MEEEE

71
00:03:18,603 --> 00:03:20,900
You can own the hammer, you can own the drill,

72
00:03:21,021 --> 00:03:23,420
But if you can't explain the work, you ain't got the skill.

73
00:03:23,541 --> 00:03:26,120
The machine ain't the villain, the machine ain't the king,

74
00:03:26,220 --> 00:03:28,590
It's the human who forgot that they're supposed to fucking think.

75
00:03:28,745 --> 00:03:30,380
SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (NOW!)

76
