PRESS ENTER! (ENTER!)

80
00:03:40,184 --> 00:03:42,136
Watch the bullshit go round and round!

81
00:03:43,424 --> 00:03:45,063
SLOPOCALYPSE NOW! (NOW!)

82
00:03:45,666 --> 00:03:48,503
The lights are on but the minds shut down!

83
00:03:48,665 --> 00:03:50,162
SLOPOCALYPSE NOW!

84
00:03:53,586 --> 00:03:55,281
SLOPOCALYPSE NOW!

85
00:03:57,106 --> 00:03:59,283
"Hey, this song is actually pretty good."

86
00:04:01,068 --> 00:04:02,139
"Thanks. An AI wrote it."

87
00:04:02,645 --> 00:04:03,803
"Oh. Did you check the lyrics?"

88
00:04:05,620 --> 00:04:06,118
"...Ship it."
